    "_doc": "The Docks' floor (docs/region-design.md §1): two rows north a purchase, from y -4 to y 8. Priced in what a chapter 9 factory makes, within the pack it has then; each row costs more than the last, and every row less a cell than Floor Expansion's fifth, in raw goods (region-design §7).",
